#   Ontology    iqnpl_ontology    = 8dd31e82-8dd0-44b0-b0fb-d70457b9b4da
#   GraphModel  (companion)       = 300e63d8-9957-419d-8746-e3c0dc56e07e

# --- Phase 5 agent/eval reference (issue #24) ---
# Foundry account/project (eastus2) hosting the models + the knowledge-base synthesis LLM:
#   Account  tchack-resource   Project  tchack
#   Endpoint https://tchack-resource.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/tchack
#   AOAI uri https://tchack-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com
#   Models   gpt-5.4 (LLM, 2026-03-05) · gpt-5.4-mini (SLM, 2026-03-17) — both GlobalStandard
# Grounding (adopted): Azure AI Search svc srch-w764vytma4qre (eastus2), api 2026-05-01-preview;
#   knowledge source iqnpl-ontology-ks (kind fabricOntology) + knowledge base iqnpl-ontology-kb.
#   See docs/verified-capabilities.md §2b for why the KB retrieve path grounds where the tool paths don't.
